OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment CEO defends response to
OL,4,Ahealthcare report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Government of Jersey's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive officer (CEO) has insisted
OL,8,Fthat the future of healthcare funding
OL,9,Fis "a significant priority" following
OL,10,Fcriticism from a scrutiny panel.
OL,12,FDeputy Karen Wilson accused Paul Wylie
OL,13,Fof delivering an "underwhelming"
OL,14,Fresponse to an official report on the
OL,15,Fissue.
OL,17,FIn July, the government's spending
OL,18,Fwatchdog said the "risk of rising
OL,19,Fexpenditure on health has been known
OL,20,Ffor a long time, and that prioritised
OL,21,Faction is needed".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
