OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment CEO defends response to
OL,4,Ahealthcare report
OL,5,
OL,6,FWylie said if their response had given
OL,7,Fthe impression that it was not a
OL,8,Fpriority, the truth was "absolutely the
OL,9,Fopposite".
